===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Nl-mager.ogg|Audio|lang=nl}}

===Adjective===
{{nl-adj}}

# [[lean]], (nearly) without [[fat]]
# [[meager]], [[skinny]], [[thin]]
# [[poor]], [[pitiful]], [[skim]]
#: ''Zo'n mager loon betekent '''magere''' melk en '''mager''' vertier!
#:: ''Such meager wages mean skimmed milk and poor entertainment!
